pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 50]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [0, 0, 213, 50]
    content:
      style: "$navText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Intro</p>
  - elementId: nav2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [213, 0, 214, 50]
    content:
      style: "$navText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Stack</p>
  - elementId: nav3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [427, 0, 213, 50]
    content:
      style: "$navText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Backlog</p>
  - elementId: nav4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 0, 214, 50]
    content:
      style: "$navText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Pipeline</p>
  - elementId: nav5
    elementType: text
    bounds: [854, 0, 213, 50]
    content:
      style: "$navText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Vistas</strong></p>
  - elementId: nav6
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1067, 0, 213, 50]
    content:
      style: "$navText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Arquitectura</p>
  - elementId: nav-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [854, 50, 213, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 65, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Vista – Dashboard y Landing</strong></p>
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 80, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: card1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 130, 540, 380]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderGray"}
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000015"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: img1
    elementType: image
    bounds: [70, 140, 520, 300]
    src: "E:\\PaginasQueHice\\SIMAApp\\output\\playwright\\ui_eval\\dashboard_light.png"
    fit:
      mode: cover
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [2000]
  - elementId: cap1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [70, 450, 520, 40]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: true
      text: |
        <p>Dashboard principal con cursos, créditos, racha y actividad reciente</p>
  - elementId: card2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [630, 130, 540, 380]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderGray"}
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000015"
      offset: [0, 4]
  - elementId: img2
    elementType: image
    bounds: [640, 140, 520, 300]
    src: "E:\\PaginasQueHice\\SIMAApp\\output\\playwright\\ui_eval\\landing_light.png"
    fit:
      mode: cover
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [2000]
  - elementId: cap2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 450, 520, 40]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: true
      text: |
        <p>Landing page con acceso a la plataforma y selección de planes</p>
  - elementId: note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 530, 1160, 120]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 16
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>El <strong>dashboard</strong> muestra una visión general del progreso: cursos registrados, créditos disponibles, racha actual, actividad reciente y próximas recomendaciones. La <strong>landing</strong> permite el registro, inicio de sesión y selección de plan (gratuito, estándar o premium) con asignación de créditos.</p>
  - elementId: page-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1200, 690, 60, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>9</p>
